*  KEYS                                                                 KEYS0001
*  PROGRAMMED BY R.L. MORRISON   JUNE 1960                              KEYS0002
*  THIS PROGRAM EXAMINES A PROGRAM LISTING TAPE AND PRINTS OUT ALL IN-  KEYS0003
*  STRUCTIONS WHOSE DIRECT ADDRESSES EQUAL THE LOCATION IN THE MQ KEYS. KEYS0004
       REL                                                              KEYS0005
       ORG     0                                                        KEYS0006
 KEYS  REWB    4                  REWIND LISTING TAPE                   KEYS0007
       REWB    5                  REWIND OUTPUT TAPE                    KEYS0008
       ENK                        ENTER TEST ADDRESS FROM KEYS INTO MQ  KEYS0009
       STQ     TEST               STORE TEST LOCATION IN LOCN TEST      KEYS0010
       WTDB    5                  PRINT OUT JOB IDENTIFICATION (RETURN  KEYS0011
       RCHB    ANSW               HERE IF CHANGE KEY ENTRY AND RERUN)   KEYS0012
       RTDB    4                  READ IN NEXT RECORD                   KEYS0013
       RCHB    ANSW+4             X                                     KEYS0014
       TCOB    *                  X                                     KEYS0015
       CLA     LOOK+3             PUT DIRECT ADDRESS OF INST IN AC      KEYS0016
       ARS     6                  X                                     KEYS0017
       CAS     TEST               IS DIRECT ADDRESS OF INST=LOCN IN KEYSKEYS0018
       TRA     *+9                X   NO                                KEYS0019
       TRA     *+2                X   YES                               KEYS0020
       TRA     *+7                X   NO                                KEYS0021
       WTDB    5                  X   YES, SO PRINT OUT RECORD          KEYS0022
       RCHB    ANSW+6             X                                     KEYS0023
       TCOB    *                                                        KEYS0024
       CLA     TEST+1             UPDATE COUNT OF FINDINGS              KEYS0025
       ADD     TEST+3             X                                     KEYS0026
       STO     TEST+1             X                                     KEYS0027
       AXT     20,4               CLEAR INPUT STORAGE AREA SO IF NEXT   KEYS0028
       CLA     NAME+30            RECORD IS SHORT BUT TO BE PRINTED,    KEYS0029
       STO     LOOK+20,4          WILL NOT OUTPUT PART OF PREVIOUS ONE  KEYS0030
       TIX     *-1,4,1            WITH IT.                              KEYS0031
       TEFB    *+2                WAS THAT THE LAST RECORD              KEYS0032
       TRA     KEYS+6             NO                                    KEYS0033
       AXT     5,1                YES, CONVERT FINDINGS COUNT TO BCD    KEYS0034
       CLA     TEST+1             X                                     KEYS0035
       LRS     3                  X                                     KEYS0036
       ALS     3                  X                                     KEYS0037
       LRS     6                  X                                     KEYS0038
       TIX     *-2,1,1            X                                     KEYS0039
       ALS     2                  X                                     KEYS0040
       LRS     2                  X                                     KEYS0041
       STQ     TEST+2             X                                     KEYS0042
       WTDB    5                  PRINT OUT NUMBER OF FINDINGS          KEYS0043
       RCHB    ANSW+7             X                                     KEYS0044
       WTDB    5                  PRINT OUT BLANK LINE                  KEYS0045
       RCHB    ANSW+3             X                                     KEYS0046
       TCOB    *                  X                                     KEYS0047
       STZ     TEST+1             ZEROIZE COUNT OF FINDINGS             KEYS0048
       REWB    4                  REWIND LISTING TAPE                   KEYS0049
       HPR                        EXIT                                  KEYS0050
*  NOW THE KEYS MUST BE CHANGED OR THE PROGRAM WILL DO THE SAME THING   KEYS0051
*  OVER AGAIN. IF MORE LOCATIONS ARE TO BE TESTED ENTER THE NEXT ONE IN KEYS0052
*  THE KEYS AND PRESS START. THIS MAY BE REPEATED INDEFINITELY.         KEYS0053
*  WHEN NO FURTHER TESTS ARE DESIRED ZEROIZE THE KEYS AND PRESS START.  KEYS0054
*                                                                       KEYS0055
       ENK                        SEE IF WANT RERUN USING NEW TEST ADDR KEYS0056
       STQ     TEST               X                                     KEYS0057
       CLA     TEST               X                                     KEYS0058
       TNZ     KEYS+4             X   YES                               KEYS0059
       WEFB    5                  X   NO, REWIND OUTPUT TAPE            KEYS0060
       REWB    5                  X                                     KEYS0061
       HTR     KEYS               X                                     KEYS0062
 NAME  BCI     9, LIST OF INSTRUCTIONS REFERENCING THE LOCATION ENTERED KEYS0063
       BCI     2, INTO KEYS (                                           KEYS0064
       BCI     9, TOTAL NUMBER OF INSTRUCTIONS FOUND REFERRING TO THE L KEYS0065
       BCI     6,OCATION ENTERED INTO THE KEYS WAS                      KEYS0066
       BCI     2, (OCTAL).                                              KEYS0067
       BCI     2, OCTAL).                                               KEYS0068
       OCT     606060606060                                             KEYS0069
 LOOK  BSS     21                 STORAGE FOR RECORD BEING EXAMINED     KEYS0070
 TEST  PZE     0                  STORAGE FOR TEST ADDRESS              KEYS0071
       PZE     0                  STORAGE FOR NUMBER OF FINDINGS IN BIN KEYS0072
       PZE     0                  STORAGE FOR NUMBER OF FINDINGS IN BCD KEYS0073
       DEC     1                                                        KEYS0074
 ANSW  IOCP    NAME,,11           PRINT OUT JOB TITLE, LOCATION TESTING KEYS0075
       IOCP    TEST,,1            X                                     KEYS0076
       IOCD    NAME+28,,2         X                                     KEYS0077
       IOCD    NAME+30,,1         BLANK                                 KEYS0078
       IORP    LOOK,,21           RECORD BEING EXAMINED                 KEYS0079
       IOCD    LOOK+20,,0         X                                     KEYS0080
       IOCD    LOOK,,20           RECORD (AND BLANK FILLERS) FOR OUTPUT KEYS0081
       IOCP    NAME+11,,15        PRINT OUT NUMBER OF FINDINGS          KEYS0082
       IOCP    TEST+2,,1          X                                     KEYS0083
       IOCD    NAME+26,,2         X                                     KEYS0084
       END     KEYS                                                     KEYS0085
